"details":{}},"color":"#aee00b","stack":{"ru":"Мобильная разработка","en":"Mobile development"}},{"project":"piterpy","title":{"ru":"PiterPy","en":"PiterPy"},"url":{"ru":"https://piterpy.com/","en":"https://piterpy.com/en/"},"logo":{"id":"3076056a-6953-48f0-ad10-3b0d7cd31118","title":"piterpy.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/3076056a-6953-48f0-ad10-3b0d7cd31118/piterpy.svg","fileName":"piterpy.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#6638ff","stack":{"ru":"Python","en":"Python"}},{"project":"safecode","title":{"ru":"SafeCode","en":"SafeCode"},"url":{"ru":"https://safecodeconf.ru/","en":"https://safecodeconf.ru/"},"logo":{"id":"d87bdae3-1381-471c-bec8-691bcc7e6abe","title":"safecode.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/d87bdae3-1381-471c-bec8-691bcc7e6abe/safecode.svg","fileName":"safecode.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#fecf16","stack":{"ru":"AppSec","en":"AppSec"}},{"project":"smartdata","title":{"ru":"SmartData","en":"SmartData"},"url":{"ru":"https://smartdataconf.ru/","en":"https://smartdataconf.ru/en/"},"logo":{"id":"e6f0783d-b91c-46c6-be2b-2f113f63c229","title":"smartdata.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/e6f0783d-b91c-46c6-be2b-2f113f63c229/smartdata.svg","fileName":"smartdata.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#44d8b1","stack":{"ru":"Data Engineering","en":"Data Engineering"}},{"project":"tt","title":{"ru":"TechTrain","en":"TechTrain"},"url":{"ru":"https://techtrain.ru/","en":"https://techtrain.ru/"},"logo":{"id":"8349dfdd-d9ed-4be9-9771-007d399c40e9","title":"techtrain.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/8349dfdd-d9ed-4be9-9771-007d399c40e9/techtrain.svg","fileName":"techtrain.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#ff5e29"},{"project":"videotech","title":{"ru":"VideoTech","en":"VideoTech"},"url":{"ru":"https://vtconf.com/","en":"https://vtconf.com/en/"},"logo":{"id":"b28d58c7-2204-4177-b7b9-dd244015638c","title":"videotech.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/b28d58c7-2204-4177-b7b9-dd244015638c/videotech.svg","fileName":"videotech.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#20bdff","stack":{"ru":"Video & Streaming","en":"Video & Streaming"}},{"project":"sysconf","title":{"ru":"sysconf","en":"sysconf"},"url":{"ru":"https://sysconf.pro/","en":"https://sysconf.pro/"},"logo":{"id":"cecf9277-b0dd-4adb-8b66-d748d13ed382","title":"sysconf.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/cecf9277-b0dd-4adb-8b66-d748d13ed382/sysconf.svg","fileName":"sysconf.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#4c5aff","stack":{"ru":"Системное программирование","en":"System programming"}}],"meta":{"title":"SnowOne 2026 | Подача заявки на доклад | У Java-сообщества Сибири есть традиция: раз в год собираемся офлайн в Новосибирске и говорим про Java и JVM — это то, что мы любим, практикуем, хотим и можем развивать.","description":"Всё о том, как стать спикером SnowOne 2026: как подать заявку, как выбрать тему, какие доклады подойдут, как выглядит процесс рассмотрения"},"localeConfig":{"locales":["ru"],"defaultLocale":"ru"},"locale":"ru","programCommittee":[{"id":"96c204ade69045608c4939e28b0cfa71","name":{"ru":"Никита Липский","en":"Nikita Lipsky"},"personRating":50,"bio":{"ru":"<p>Работаю над проектом Compose Multiplatform &mdash; кроссплатформенным UI-фреймворком, который разрабатывает JetBrains в сотрудничестве с Google. В прошлом &mdash; разработчик JVM в Excelsior и Huawei. Инициатор проекта Excelsior JET &mdash; JVM c AOT-компилятором.</p>\n<p>Частый спикер на российских и зарубежных Java-/Kotlin-конференциях и митапах.</p>","en":"<p>Nikita works on the Compose Multiplatform project, a cross-platform UI framework being developed by JetBrains in cooperation with Google. He is a former JVM developer at Excelsior and Huawei. Initiator of Excelsior JET project &mdash; JVM with AOT compiler.</p>\n<p>Frequent speaker at Russian and foreign Java/Kotlin conferences and meetups.</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"5tppmFH2IvmR9rdrRPRiRI","title":"100315_675550711_Nikita_Lipskiy_Nas_Spring_Boot__a_my_krepchayem__nevynosimaya_legkost_AOT-kompilyatsii_Spring-prilozheniy.png","url":"/squidex/srm/5tppmFH2IvmR9rdrRPRiRI/100315-675550711-nikita-lipskiy-nas-spring-boot-a-my-krepchayem-nevynosimaya-legkost-aot-kompilyatsii-spring-prilozheniy.png","fileName":"100315_675550711_Nikita_Lipskiy_Nas_Spring_Boot__a_my_krepchayem__nevynosimaya_legkost_AOT-kompilyatsii_Spring-prilozheniy.png","contentType":"image/png","details":{"image":{"width":334,"height":334}}},"contacts":[{"type":"github","value":"https://github.com/pjBooms"}],"achievements":null,"isPartner":false,"contributorId":22007449},{"id":"4094a6cdb60f4fb7a3a882fcee90ad38","name":{"ru":"Тагир Валеев","en":"Tagir Valeev"},"personRating":50,"bio":{"ru":"<p>Java Champion, коммиттер OpenJDK, член экспертной группы проекта Amber. Разрабатываю опенсорсную библиотеку StreamEx. Автор <a href=\"https://habr.com/ru/users/tagir_valeev/publications/articles/\">статей</a> на Хабре.</p>","en":"<p>Java Champion, OpenJDK committer, member of the Amber project expert group. Develops StreamEx, an open-source library. Writes <a href=\"https://habr.com/ru/users/tagir_valeev/publications/articles/\">atricles</a> for habr.com.</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"2j0DRtZPB51kGEG3UUwMNt","title":"Tagir_Valeyev.jpg","url":"/squidex/srm/2j0DRtZPB51kGEG3UUwMNt/tagir_valeyev.jpg","fileName":"Tagir_Valeyev.jpg","contentType":"image/png","details":{"image":{"width":331,"height":297}}},"contacts":[],"achievements":"Java Champion","isPartner":false,"contributorId":22006345},{"id":"854cb6a9afea4cd092ce1b15c29cc1f3","name":{"ru":"Михаил Грищенко","en":"Mikhail Grishchenko"},"personRating":50,"bio":{"ru":"<p>Обеспечиваю качество компиляторов и виртуальных машин. Участвовал в разработке JetBrains Runtime.</p>","en":"<p>-</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"2395e3ff-f88f-4ca6-a6ef-bcd9d8fea5c8","title":"IMG_20211116_171826.jpg","url":"/squidex/srm/2395e3ff-f88f-4ca6-a6ef-bcd9d8fea5c8/img-20211116-171826.jpg","fileName":"IMG_20211116_171826.jpg","contentType":"image/png","details":{"image":{"width":363,"height":315}}},"contacts":[],"achievements":null,"isPartner":false,"contributorId":22005357},{"id":"6cbdfa6071dc4fa3925fbdc8e3d123fe","name":{"ru":"Владимир Плизга","en":"Vladimir Plizga"},"personRating":50,"company":{"ru":"Tibbo Systems","en":"Tibbo Systems"},"bio":{"ru":"<p>Со школьной скамьи увлечен программированием и с тех пор успел покодировать на многом: от советских программируемых калькуляторов до современных станков с ЧПУ. Почти 15 последних лет профессиональной карьеры посвятил разработке бэкенда на Java: сначала в финтехе, затем в промышленном IoT.</p><p>Люблю помогать людям, поэтому, кроме организации регулярных TechTalks в своих командах, выступаю на митапах и конференциях. Иногда пишу статьи по темам вокруг JVM и разрабатываю open source-инструменты для упрощения повседневных задач бэкенд-разработки и тестирования.</p><p>Веду тренинги по производительности приложений на Java. Автор Telegram-канала <a href=\"https://t.me/stopshelf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">«Верхняя полка»</a>, в котором делюсь своими мыслями и наблюдениями.</p>\n","en":"<p>Vladimir has been passionate about programming since his school days and had the opportunity to code on a variety of platforms: from Soviet programmable calculators to modern CNC machines. However, for the past 10+ years of his professional career, he has dedicated himself to backend development using Java: first in fintech, and then in industrial IoT.</p>\n<p>He enjoys helping people, so in addition to organizing regular TechTalks within his teams, he speaks at meetups and conferences, occasionally writes articles on topics related to JVM, and develops open-source tools to simplify everyday tasks in backend development and testing.</p>\n<p>He conducts training sessions on Java application performance. Author of the Telegram channel <a href=\"https://t.me/stopshelf\">&lsquo;Top Shelf&rsquo;</a> where he shares his thoughts and observations.</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"37153177-3988-4f38-b72e-0abe47274ab4","title":"Vladimir-4.jpg","url":"/squidex/srm/37153177-3988-4f38-b72e-0abe47274ab4/vladimir-4.jpg","fileName":"Vladimir-4.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","details":{"image":{"width":606,"height":606}}},"contacts":[{"type":"github","value":"https://github.com/Toparvion"}],"achievements":null,"isPartner":false,"position":{"ru":"Ведущий инженер-программист","en":"Leading Software Engineer"},"contributorId":22005194},{"id":"200318601d7d400a9d506039de6c20fa","name":{"ru":"Григорий Кошелев","en":"Gregory Koshelev "},"personRating":50,"bio":{"ru":"<p>Более 10 лет разрабатываю информационные системы различной сложности и масштаба. Выступил с более чем 30 докладами на конференциях и митапах для разработчиков. Среди тем докладов &mdash; Apache Kafka, Elasticsearch, Sentry, распределенные и event-driven системы.</p>","en":"<p>Grigory has been developing information systems of various complexity and scale for more than 10 years. He has given more than 30 talks at conferences and developer meetups. The topics of his talks include Apache Kafka, Elasticsearch, Sentry, distributed and event-driven systems.</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"44d41fb4-c2b2-4307-89dc-b0a52a3ea8df","title":"koshelev-2022.jpg","url":"/squidex/srm/44d41fb4-c2b2-4307-89dc-b0a52a3ea8df/koshelev-2022.jpg","fileName":"koshelev-2022.jpg","contentType":"image/png","details":{"image":{"width":802,"height":707}}},"contacts":[],"achievements":null,"isPartner":false,"contributorId":22003021},{"id":"25a14d7b02c44fe991f40d3d351cd42a","name":{"ru":"Анастасия Некрашевич","en":"Anastasiia Nekrashevich"},"personRating":50,"bio":{"ru":"<p>Последние 10 лет разрабатываю бэкенд на Java для интернет-банков, кроме этого веду семинары для желающих попасть в профессию Java-разработчика.</p>\n<p>Отвлекаюсь от работы на сноубординг и кроссфит.</p>","en":"<p>-</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"4c689501-2aac-4203-9f55-b06f4b468fc7","title":"IMG_0068.jpg","url":"/squidex/srm/4c689501-2aac-4203-9f55-b06f4b468fc7/img-0068.jpg","fileName":"IMG_0068.jpg","contentType":"image/png","details":{"image":{"width":3346,"height":3403}}},"contacts":[],"achievements":null,"isPartner":false,"contributorId":22000264},{"id":"9cbc880fd47843e29e543fd37f95bbef","name":{"ru":"Иван Углянский","en":"Ivan Ugliansky"},"personRating":50,"company":{"ru":"Huawei","en":"Huawei"},"bio":{"ru":"<p>C 2011 года работал в компании Excelsior, где был одним из разработчиков Excelsior JET &mdash; сертифицированной реализации Java SE, основанной на оптимизирующей AOT-компиляции. Сейчас работаю над компиляторами, JVM и новыми языками программирования. В основном занимаюсь рантаймом: GC, загрузкой классов, поддержкой многопоточности, профилированием и так далее.</p>\n<p>Сооснователь и один из лидеров JUGNsk &mdash; официальной Java User Group в Новосибирске. Один из основателей профиля &laquo;Системное программирование&raquo; на ММФ НГУ, где преподаю на многих курсах.</p>","en":"<p>I worked for Excelsior in the Excelsior JET project (Java SE certified implementation based on optimizing AOT compilation). Now I work for Huawei on JVMs, compilers, and new programming languages. I mainly work with runtime: GC, class loading, concurrency maintenance, profiling, and so on.</p>\n<p>I'm also the co-founder and co-lead of JUGNsk, an official Java Users Group in Novosibirsk. In my free time, I teach C++, algorithms and Python courses at Novosibirsk State University.</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"1u8fr0uaS7sLocTSy8MCZ4","title":"kXjgjPbMYcY.jpg","url":"/squidex/srm/1u8fr0uaS7sLocTSy8MCZ4/kxjgjpbmycy.jpg","fileName":"kXjgjPbMYcY.jpg","contentType":"image/png","details":{"image":{"width":353,"height":346}}},"contacts":[{"type":"github","value":"https://github.com/ugliansky"}],"achievements":null,"isPartner":false,"position":{"ru":"Эксперт","en":"Expert"},"contributorId":22000214},{"id":"9c887a2a30ab48bcbf8c375a83c3892e","name":{"ru":"Александр Кучук","en":"Alexander Kuchuk"},"personRating":50,"bio":{"ru":"<p>Преподаю во ВШЭ, преподавал в МФТИ. Team Lead, Java-разработчик.</p>","en":"<p>I teache at the Higher School of Economics, taught at MIPT. Team Lead, Java developer.</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"5b9ef070-70cd-4eca-9bd7-f82bb6bb6b3d","title":"photo_2024-04-02 16.28.42.jpeg","url":"/squidex/srm/5b9ef070-70cd-4eca-9bd7-f82bb6bb6b3d/photo-2024-04-02-16.28.42.jpeg","fileName":"photo_2024-04-02 16.28.42.jpeg","contentType":"image/png","details":{"image":{"width":804,"height":750}}},"contacts":[],"achievements":null,"isPartner":false,"contributorId":22000576}],"cfp":{"ogImage":{"ru":{"id":"1a187c6a-0cac-46fb-92ce-efbdc3a24dfe","title":"SnowOne_cfp.jpg","url":"/squidex/sites/1a187c6a-0cac-46fb-92ce-efbdc3a24dfe/snowone-cfp.jpg","fileName":"SnowOne_cfp.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","details":{"image":{"width":1920,"height":863}}},"en":{"id":"1a187c6a-0cac-46fb-92ce-efbdc3a24dfe","title":"SnowOne_cfp.jpg","url":"/squidex/sites/1a187c6a-0cac-46fb-92ce-efbdc3a24dfe/snowone-cfp.jpg","fileName":"SnowOne_cfp.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","details":{"image":{"width":1920,"height":863}}}},"banner":{"title":{"ru":"Если у вас есть вопросы или предложения — свяжитесь с нами.","en":"-"},"image":{"ru":{"id":"b38929ac-4d09-4326-b6b6-5d3e8417dab2","title":"cfp_snowone.svg","url":"/squidex/sites/b38929ac-4d09-4326-b6b6-5d3e8417dab2/cfp-snowone.svg","fileName":"cfp_snowone.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"en":{"id":"b38929ac-4d09-4326-b6b6-5d3e8417dab2","title":"cfp_snowone.svg","url":"/squidex/sites/b38929ac-4d09-4326-b6b6-5d3e8417dab2/cfp-snowone.svg","fileName":"cfp_snowone.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}}},"links":[{"text":{"ru":"Задать вопрос","en":"Ask a question"},"href":{"ru":"mailto:org@snowone.ru","en":"mailto:support@jugru.team"}}]},"topicsText":{"ru":"Отдельно отметим, что мы ищем доклады и для студенческого дня — причем они могут быть не так уж связаны с Java! Если у вас есть тема, которая, как вам кажется, будет интересна и полезна студенческой аудитории, подавайте и ее тоже с пометкой «на студенческий день».","en":"Отдельно отметим, что мы ищем доклады и для студенческого дня — причем они могут быть не так уж связаны с Java! Если у вас есть тема, которая, как вам кажется, будет интересна и полезна студенческой аудитории, подавайте и ее тоже с пометкой «на студенческий день»."},"topicsByCategory":[[{"ru":"Enterprise Java","en":"-"},[{"category":{"ru":"Enterprise Java","en":"-"},"title":{"ru":"Популярные фреймфорки: Spring, Hibernate, Helidon, Quarkus и другие.","en":"-"}},{"category":{"ru":"Enterprise Java","en":"-"},"title":{"ru":"Средства разработки: Maven, Gradle.","en":"-"}},{"category":{"ru":"Enterprise Java","en":"-"},"title":{"ru":"HTTP-серверы (Apache Tomcat, Jetty, Undertow) и HTTP-клиенты (Feign, Retrofit, Apache HttpClient).","en":"-"}},{"category":{"ru":"Enterprise Java","en":"-"},"title":{"ru":"Работа с базами данных.","en":"-"}},{"category":{"ru":"Enterprise Java","en":"-"},"title":{"ru":"Архитектура.","en":"-"}},{"category":{"ru":"Enterprise Java","en":"-"},"title":{"ru":"Тестирование: фаззинг, мутационное тестирование. Новые фреймворки и подходы в тестировании.","en":"-"}}]],[{"ru":"JVM internals","en":"-"},[{"category":{"ru":"JVM internals","en":"-"},"title":{"ru":"JVM/JDK под капотом: компиляторы, рантаймы, алгоритмы GC.","en":"-"}},{"category":{"ru":"JVM internals","en":"-"},"title":{"ru":"Оптимизация производительности Java и JVM.","en":"-"}},{"category":{"ru":"JVM internals","en":"-"},"title":{"ru":"Проекты OpenJDK: Valhalla, Panama, Leyden, Loom и другие.","en":"-"}}]],[{"ru":"Другие JVM-языки","en":"-"},[{"category":{"ru":"Другие JVM-языки","en":"-"},"title":{"ru":"Kotlin: язык, компилятор, серверная часть, библиотеки.","en":"-"}},{"category":{"ru":"Другие JVM-языки","en":"-"},"title":{"